Subject: NSS 11.4 Linux 6.18 / modern GCC compatibility (consolidated)

Source: 53e5863 (11.4.0.5, 2021-09-13). Apply after the 41
unmodified upstream patches. This one delta replaces the previous
local 0900 through 0904; do not append those legacy local patches.

Includes the Linux 6.18/NAPI port, private-function linkage and
exported prototypes, translation-unit self-header visibility,
and braces around the coredump conditional with disabled logging.
Logging macros and external message layouts are not changed here.
Source patch tests do not constitute a kernel/compiler/runtime test.

--- a/compat.h
+++ b/compat.h
